From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] schtasks: create from the command line, query, run, end, change (3525)

schtasks: create from the command line, query, run, end, change

/create now takes /SC MINUTE|HOURLY|DAILY|WEEKLY|MONTHLY|ONCE|ONSTART|ONLOGON|ONIDLE|ONEVENT with /MO /D /M
/ST /SD /ED /TR /RU /RL /EC /F and builds the task XML; a task for another account, SYSTEM or the highest
run level is for an administrator. /query lists tasks as table, list or csv (/V, /NH, /TN, /XML), /run and
/end act on a task, /change takes /TR /ENABLE /DISABLE and /RU (administrator).
